327	// deliberately no reconciler-side re-pin. An implicit one would be a control
328	// plane rescue for a condition only the pool agent can detect — whether the
329	// pinned image can actually be run there — and it would fire on reconciles a
330	// user never asked for (ADR 0021 §§2, 5).
